## Template updates

This repository was created from `FaeyUmbrea/module-template`. The source recorded in `.copier-answers.yml` should be `gh:FaeyUmbrea/module-template`, not a path to somebody's local checkout. With a clean worktree, update its shared machinery using:

```sh
uvx copier update
```
